The page bundle (ui/dist/index.mjs) is built from this repository's own
sources and bundles no third-party code: React, TanStack Query, lucide-react
and the Kiro Crew App SDK are provided by the Kiro Crew dashboard at run time.
The backend uses aiohttp and markdown-it-py, which the Kiro Crew gateway
provides. The test suites install their pinned dependencies
(tests/requirements.txt, ui/package-lock.json), Kiro Crew among them, into a
test environment only.
